"""
Extended analyses on top of the v2 logit-lens results.

Adds four things:
  1. Entropy on the 21 audit heads (case-study captures, ACCA vs TATI only)
  2. Snap-layer histograms split by predicted Yes/No direction
  3. Captioning-only logit lens (the 59 captioning Q/A * 4 configs)
  4. Residual-trajectory analysis: does late-layer residual at answer position
     stay close to layer-18 (post-conflict-heads) or move toward the predicted
     token's embedding?

INPUTS:
  - /workspace/acca_work/residual_output/*.pt   (5,360 captures from v2 run)
  - /workspace/acca_work/capture_output/*.pt    (38 attention captures, case study)
  - /workspace/acca_work/analysis_output_v2/per_capture.parquet
  - /workspace/acca_work/analysis_output_v2/per_layer.parquet
  - /workspace/acca_work/causal_head_map.json   (output of head ablation audit)
  - /workspace/VideoLLaMA2-7B-AV/                (model weights)

OUTPUTS:
  /workspace/acca_work/analysis_output_v2/extended/
    extended_1_entropy_per_head.{png,pdf}
    extended_2_snap_by_pred_dir.{png,pdf}
    extended_3_captioning_logit_lens.{png,pdf}
    extended_3b_captioning_snap_histogram.{png,pdf}
    extended_4_residual_trajectory.{png,pdf}
    entropy_per_head.csv
    residual_trajectory.parquet
"""
